# Compatibles that never bind a driver of their own. Used with dt_driver_coverage.py --ignore.
anbernic,rg34xx-sp          # machine compatible (root node)
arm,cortex-a53              # CPU nodes, handled by the architecture code
cache                       # L2 cache description
simple-battery              # battery data, read by the charger/fuel-gauge driver
allwinner,sun20i-d1-hstimer # only selectable on 32-bit ARM; arm64 uses the architected timer (arm,armv8-timer)
